your time and dime<br><br>   - A Combination of Narrative Expression and Animated Art Sequences<br><br>   - An Extra Art Gallery with 15+ Art Images - with Story Trivia Information <br><br>   - A Bonus &quot;Secret Epilogue&quot; separate from the Main Story Route<br>   <br>   - A Moral Ethical Lesson That Could Add Value To Your Life  <br><br>   - A Rare Chance to Discover the Story of Nami <br><br>  - Original STEAM Version offers quality-enhancement updates. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159430/extras/c9d7cbd8df5b58288e18c37a1ab3644e.avif?t=1738554729\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159430/extras/fe492d39d497ca9ee646842dff838a45.avif?t=1738554729\" /></div><br><br>Systematic Insanity is a dramatic mystery story. <br><br>As the story progresses through its final chapters and climax, <br>the title itself - &quot;Systematic Insanity&quot; - can begin to make sense.<br><br>One of the Best Features of Systematic Insanity is the Story itself.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159430/extras/20c96229e4a8c1256d483c086450e642.avif?t=1738554729\" /></div><br><br><br>Those who fully play this &quot;movie game&quot; can understand its gameplay design. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159430/extras/8e72b55cc4f5375cf2a78b3f97032f93.avif?t=1738554729\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159430/extras/c1e757a47ba233dbf78a8a2d859dfe26.avif?t=1738554729\" /></div><br><br>Go beyond first impressions to uncover its &quot;secret story&quot;!<br><br>Clue: The Yellow Door <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159430/extras/cd556c60a4a825ad288cb6fb5ca873f0.avif?t=1738554729\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159430/extras/867866224f656f6f496a235b8b563e67.avif?t=1738554729\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nami is the heroine of Systematic Insanity.</h2><br><br>Since she excels in both academic and athletic subjects, <br>she's considered a Perfect Student and School Role Model.<br><br>Her near-perfect status, abilities and ethical values are put to the test. <br>She never thought that her Final Exam would be on her Graduation Day!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159430/extras/c8a542b3ecb601a4182fe780ad11a229.avif?t=1738554729\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mysterious Red-Haired Lady</h2><br><br>She is refined in taste and manner and is extremely wealthy too. <br><br>Beyond these first impressions, lies a weird discovery <br>which includes a biological secret that mirrors herself.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159430/extras/08837f74834634bedc20cf76835439f3.avif?t=1738554729\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Loraine is Nami's Best Friend.</h2><br><br>She learned to break her &quot;shy shell&quot; with Nami's inspired guidance. <br><br>As the School's Official Event Host, she is also fondly called MC Loraine.<br>Her close friendship with Nami becomes a Key Link to the Story's Events. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159430/extras/81c5c6e27d4ad906d15fadc91d6db414.avif?t=1738554729\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nami in Bikini Mode. </h2><br><br>In Systematic Insanity, the heroine's &quot;need to wear&quot; a swimsuit <br>has a logical reason behind it and is actually a key point in the story's events. <br><br>It has more to do with friendship, courage and sacrifice <br>and is not just a display of beauty and sexiness. <br><br>It is a noble choice.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Final Notes: Summary</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159430/extras/4adc82e6c585d4f327600eef2e85b590.avif?t=1738554729\" /></div><br><br>Systematic Insanity is a movie game with a hidden story factor. <br><br>If you can remember that simple joy of  enjoying a story you liked, <br><br>then this movie game might be worth your buy and try. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159430/extras/27ca872efb73b96bcb936d5518ef327f.avif?t=1738554729\" /></div><br><br>If you're now curious or  simply interested.. then why not play this &quot;movie game&quot;? <br><br>It could be that special hidden gem - YOU NEVER KNEW YOU WERE LOOKING FOR. <br><br>Witness the Story of Nami. <br><br>It is the Story of Systematic Insanity. <br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FAQs</h2></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Q: How I Do Pause This Movie Game?</h2><br>A: The Menu Button is also the Pause Button.<br>Each Conversation Moment is a chance to PAUSE and SAVE.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Q. Will there be a Sequel?</h2><br>A:There are no promises at this time. <br>But the Secret Epilogue is a potential clue.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Q: Why is the title called Systematic Insanity?</h2><br>A: As you discover the Final Chapters, it begins to make more sense. <br>The Best Way to understand it - is to Fully Watch it yourself. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159430/extras/8666b8b8743d6343cec3a2681cbfa50a.avif?t=173